&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Customer centric orientation — actively thinks about how to improve the user experience of trading on Nomina&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;User research mastery – design and execute user research, build lasting relationships with users, transform qualitative insights into quantitative experiments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Detail oriented – every pixel matters. Ensure the user experience is perfect&lt;/li&gt;
