&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with trading platforms or financial products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with crypto/DeFi (can be learned if you&#39;re sharp)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical background (helpful but not required)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
